
note <Typed message-passing channel for concurrent tasks.>

form channel
  head item
  case sender
    link id, like text
  case receiver
    link id, like text

task make
  head item
  send back
    like channel
      fuse item, read item

task send
  head item
  take target
    like channel
      fuse item, read item
  take value, like item

task receive
  head item
  take source
    like channel
      fuse item, read item
  send back
    like item
